					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">NOW hollow fires burn out to black,<br /> And lights are guttering low:<br /> Square your shoulders, lift your pack,<br /> And leave your friends and go.</span></p> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">Oh never fear, man, nought’s to dread,<br /> Look not left nor right:<br /> In all the endless road you tread<br /> There’s nothing but the night.<br /> - A.E Housman</span></p> <hr /></div> <br /> Hello. This was written as part of the upcoming Aces and Eights canon.<br /> Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414765&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1543197659" alt="Doctor Cimmerian" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414765)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" >Doctor Cimmerian</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4022320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1543197659" alt="RockTeethMothEyes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4022320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" >RockTeethMothEyes</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=414239&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1543197659" alt="Gabriel Jade" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=414239)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" >Gabriel Jade</a></span>, and you, the reader, for reading.
				 	]]>
